# turbo
.turbo

# Agent skills, vendored by package CLIs. `prisma skills sync` writes the same
# content into one directory per harness. A committed copy would silently drift
# from the installed package version, so AGENTS.md points at node_modules instead
# and these stay out of git (ADR 0004).
**/.claude/skills/
**/.cursor/skills/
**/.agents/skills/
**/.devin/skills/

# TypeScript incremental build artifacts
*.tsbuildinfo
